  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Differentiate both sides w.r.t.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now differentiate the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#34;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#34;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#34;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#34;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
